[11:07.08]swamp [swɒmp]vt. 使陷入困境；使压倒 例 He is always swamped with work.
[11:13.20]garment [ˈɡɑːmənt]n. (一件)衣服；[pl.] 服装；外表，外 观 vt. 给…穿衣服 例 The inspiration for this garment is the bat's echolocation system. 搭 garment measure and cutting 服装量裁
[11:29.28]concise [kənˈsaɪs]a. 简明的，简洁的 例 Be sure to make your resume clear and concise and avoid long-windedness. 搭 concise dictionary 简明词典 / concise edition 简编
[11:44.52]embassy [ˈembəsi]n. 大使馆；大使馆全体人员 例 Before visiting a foreign country, you need to go to the corresponding embassy to get a visa first. 搭 send sb. on an embassy 派遣某人出任大使
[12:01.20]appease [əˈpiːz]vt. 使平息；使和缓；对…要求作出让 步；姑息 例 The move was widely seen as an attempt to appease critics of the regime.
